      <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 02:36:30 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>WquGuru</dc:creator>
      <description>http://x.com/i/article/2065613433601695744

Tweet: https://x.com/wquguru/status/2065624323952713834
Primary URLs:
