      <link>https://x.com/barrowjoseph/status/2065423284343050314</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2065423284343050314</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 13:17:39 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Joe Barrow</dc:creator>
      <description>http://x.com/i/article/2065421433048625152

Tweet: https://x.com/barrowjoseph/status/2065423284343050314
Primary URLs:
