      <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 23:15:34 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Khe Hy</dc:creator>
      <description>http://x.com/i/article/2065191795487821824

Tweet: https://x.com/khemaridh/status/2065211366953369879
