      <title>@mstockton: This is obv. making the rounds. A key adjacent idea I find interesting: There are lots...</title>
      <link>https://x.com/mstockton/status/2064844961065931084</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2064844961065931084</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 22:59:36 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Matt Stockton</dc:creator>
      <description>This is obv. making the rounds. A key adjacent idea I find interesting:
&gt;
&gt; There are lots of companies and orgs sitting on data that could be repurposed as extremely valuable ground truth. Maybe to solve their problems better, but maybe as ground truth accelerator for something totally different.
&gt;
&gt; These companies may have no intention to use the data that way, or even an understanding that they can.
&gt;
&gt; For many of these companies, it’s certain that folks are inquiring about that data and how they can buy ot or use it.
&gt;
&gt; But I am guessing for some of them (maybe long tail) they simply don’t know and no one is telling them.
&gt;
&gt; I think about this opportunity constantly - there is so much data sitting around, ready to be unlocked in interesting / unexpected ways by these models.
&gt;
&gt; And lots of it is probably sitting in the most obscure places you can even imagine.
&gt;
&gt; Never been a better time to explore weird areas and just pick up the rocks to see what’s under them

Tweet: https://x.com/mstockton/status/2064844961065931084</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Matt Stockton</strong> (<a href="https://x.com/mstockton">@mstockton</a>)</p><blockquote><p>This is obv. making the rounds. A key adjacent idea I find interesting:<br/><br/>There are lots of companies and orgs sitting on data that could be repurposed as extremely valuable ground truth. Maybe to solve their problems better, but maybe as ground truth accelerator for something totally different.<br/><br/>These companies may have no intention to use the data that way, or even an understanding that they can.<br/><br/>For many of these companies, it’s certain that folks are inquiring about that data and how they can buy ot or use it. <br/><br/>But I am guessing for some of them (maybe long tail) they simply don’t know and no one is telling them. <br/><br/>I think about this opportunity constantly - there is so much data sitting around, ready to be unlocked in interesting / unexpected ways by these models. <br/><br/>And lots of it is probably sitting in the most obscure places you can even imagine.<br/><br/>Never been a better time to explore weird areas and just pick up the rocks to see what’s under them</p></blockquote><p style="color:#777;font-size:0.9em">♥ 11 · 🔁 1 · 💬 1 · 🔖 26</p><p><a href="https://x.com/mstockton/status/2064844961065931084">View on X →</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
